WEBVTT

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:04.020
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.960
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.290
Yoru and Kiseki are gonna infiltrate Easter today!

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.490
They're going to save Ikuto, 
who's been captured by Easter!

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.620
But if it's only the two of them, 
won't they just fight?

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.230
They'll be fine!

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:21.400
Yeah! It's because they're such close 
friends that they fight!

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.850
Okay, all together now...

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.000
Doki!

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:13.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:22.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:30.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:20.650
Ah, it's no good-nya... 
My body and soul are plain worn out-nya...

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:33.450
Can't wait to see what 
today's snack will be!

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.210
Such insolence!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.680
Insolent knave! How dare you lounge 
upon the King's chaise!

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:43.550
Yoru.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.860
I was wondering where you'd gone.

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.780
That's my throne!

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:50.250
It is no place for a commoner!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.970
Answer me, you! Hey!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.140
Yoru...

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:05.480
He seems different than normal-dechu.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:09.010
He must be so worried about Ikuto-san...

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:10.460
Something happened?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.250
Yes...

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.170
What are you talking about?

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.960
Something wrong, Amu-chi?

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.100
Yeah...

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:23.970
Episode 81
Infiltration! Easter Company?!

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:27.560
So Easter did that to Tsukiyomi Ikuto?

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.770
That's right.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.750
And I believe they are 
holding him captive somewhere.

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.400
I hope Ikuto's okay...

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:42.200
All right! We should march right into 
Easter and ask them straight out!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.010
Yaya, what are you saying?

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:46.280
We can't march into Easter...

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:49.120
Wouldn't that be the fastest way?

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.540
But what'll you do when you get there?

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.880
Are you planning on asking, 
"Hey, how about that Tsukiyomi Ikuto?"

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:58.010
I'll figure that out once we get there!

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:59.420
Anyway, let's go!

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.920
Go!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.970
Yaya!

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:07.960
And they're off...

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:11.890
Even though we're all trying to assist Ikuto...

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.540
With this guy here...

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.130
Hey!

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.500
Are you okay, Yoru?

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.660
Buck up-dechu!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.880
Would you like a sardine?

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:31.820
You vile feline!

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.260
What are you doing-nya?

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:38.540
If you have time for lazing about, 
go search for Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.570
I looked for him all night-nya!

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:43.340
But I still don't have 
any idea where he is-nya!

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:46.540
In that case, perhaps we should go 
directly to Easter and investigate!

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.370
But that place is freaking huge-nya!

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:50.530
It's not easy to poke around-

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:52.100
Coward!

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:53.850
What did you...

00:04:54.140 --> 00:05:00.320
It's because his Shugo Chara's a coward that he's being controlled and did that weird Character Transformation.

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:02.740
Honestly, you're just...

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.700
Just stop talking-dechu!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.570
I feel sorry enough for him already!

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:12.040
That's right! The poor thing!

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:14.420
Don't glare at me!

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.540
I speak the truth!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.870
Sheesh...

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:26.860
Under normal circumstances, 
he would've put up more of a fight.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.930
He seems truly depressed-dechu.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.520
What should we do?

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:31.820
I know!

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:35.600
Why don't we search for clues 
about where Ikuto is, too!

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.800
All right, let's commence 
the investigation-dechu.

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:40.480
Roger!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:44.660
This is a great idea and all, 
but where should we look?

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.710
Let's try fortune-telling-dechu.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:50.400
Oh please show me a sign 
that will lead us to Ikuto...

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.490
Neat, let me try!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:56.250
Please swing in the direction we should go.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.960
I'm gonna do it, too!

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:02.970
Ow!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.340
Oh man, what are we going to do?

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.910
Whe should check out the amusement park!

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.140
The amusement park?

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:14.910
You mean the amusement park 
where Ikuto-san was last night?

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:18.000
Of course! There might be 
a clue there-dechu!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.930
You're pretty sharp today, Ran-tan.

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:23.650
Let's check it out! This way!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:28.840
Um, but where did Kiseki go?

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.900
He's probably sulking in bed-dechu.

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:32.570
Just leave him alone-dechu.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:33.600
Right...

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:42.980
I went too far before. 
Forgive me, black cat.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:46.720
No, perhaps I should get 
straight to the point...

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.410
My bad!

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.310
Maybe that's too short.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.970
I must try to sound natural...

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:57.390
My humblest apologies!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.060
All right, perfect!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:05.090
Where is he going?

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.850
So this is the scene of the crime-dechu?

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:15.580
Okay, let's split up and look for clues!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.740
Yeah!

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:20.080
Um, clues for what?

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.620
It's y'all!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.020
Oh, hey there, Nana-chan.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:25.860
May we help you?

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.400
What are you playing around here for?

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.170
We're not playing-dechu!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.800
We're looking for someone.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.050
His name is Tsukiyomi Ikuto, but...

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:35.370
Ikuto?!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.640
He looks like this, but...

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.770
Have you seen him anywhere?

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:46.140
U-Um... Nope, not laid eyes on him...

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:48.060
Something up with him?

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:49.480
Well, you see...

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:54.660
So you're saying that Tsukiyomi Ikuto 
is being controlled by Easter?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:58.350
That's what it sounds like. 
What are we to do, Lulu?

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.680
What are you talking about?

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:04.790
Whatever happens to Tsukiyomi 
Ikuto is no concern of mine.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.170
The problem is what happens next!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:11.020
If Ikuto's forced to gather
 a large number of X Eggs,

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:13.430
the Embryo will probably appear!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.670
What did you say?!

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:17.480
You've got to work harder, Lulu!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:19.530
Otherwise that guy's gone get the Embryo!

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:22.410
That's right. I don't have time for this!

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.290
So what'll you do?

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:29.690
But if I don't complete all of 
my homework perfectly, then...

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.030
This perfectionism is a problem.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.490
Pardon us!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.930
Go home.

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:51.800
This isn't a place for children to play.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:55.190
Meanies! You could at least let us in!

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:57.340
You meanie-faced mini-meanies!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:00.380
It doesn't look like they'll talk to us.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:02.320
We knew this would happen.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:05.080
Yaya, you're much too impulsive.

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:09.360
Is there any way we can sneak inside?

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:12.640
I know! Why don't we trying asking him?

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:13.490
Him?

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:15.480
Let's go!

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.840
Coward!

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:38.080
I'm definitely gonna figure 
out where Ikuto is-nya!

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:39.500
Wait!

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:40.480
It's you...

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:42.390
It's dangerous to go alone.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.800
You're the one who said to come here!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.060
Well, I was...

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.620
Well nothing, I'm <i>not</i> a coward!

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:52.480
I can find Ikuto on my own-nya!

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:55.630
Perhaps, but I'm coming with you!

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.300
Who asked for your help-nya?

00:09:57.300 --> 00:10:00.430
The King is in charge of his subject's well-being!

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.740
And that includes black cats 
with twisted personalities!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.000
Now, come!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.210
Don't go in front!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.210
But I'm the King!

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:32.390
That was close.

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:34.210
We were nearly discovered.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.630
Yeah right, you're an idiot-nya!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:36.450
What did you say?!

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.930
He can't see Guardian Characters-nya!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:44.310
And I know way more about 
Easter than you, anyway-nya.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.290
Your directions are just...

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.540
Look at that!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:50.920
It's him!

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:56.370
So "him" was...

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:57.940
Him?

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:02.110
Tell you a way to sneak into Easter?

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:05.200
Right! You used to work for Easter, after all.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:08.200
So if you know some secret underground passage or stairway-

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:11.730
Will you please not say such things so loudly?

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:17.750
Easter is a big organization.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:22.160
Even if you do manage to sneak in, 
I'm not sure you'd be able to find him...

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.510
I know, but...

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:29.750
And I'm not so sure he's in as much 
trouble as you think he is.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:34.390
But when he did that strange Character 
Transformation, he didn't look so good...

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:39.820
Then he's probably being cared for right now and they're letting him rest.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:43.570
I don't think that Easter is such a compassionate organization.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:48.690
They're just handling the human resources for their operation.

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:50.890
They take good care of their important tools, is all.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.940
That's... Ikuto isn't a tool!

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.270
That's what Easter is.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.550
We haven't seen your evil face in a while.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:04.340
Don't call my face evil!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.560
You turn into a bad guy the 
second your glasses are off!

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:08.680
Be quiet!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.920
But you're cuter that way!

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:12.190
He'll be fine, Amu-chan.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:17.170
Yes. Just like he said, we should stop and assess the situation for a little while.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:20.130
Yeah, you're right.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.900
Huh? Now that I think about it...

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:26.700
None of you have your Guardian Characters 
with you today. Why's that?

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:39.480
If we try following him, 
we might find a clue.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.670
I really hate that guy-nya!

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:44.690
It's all his fault that Ikuto 
had to go through all this-nya!

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:46.540
What do you think you're doing?

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:48.820
He can't see us, anyway-nya!

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:50.900
I'm just gonna kick his butt for a bit-nya.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.050
How dare you do that to Ikuto!

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:19.440
Can he see Guardian Characters?

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:37.100
I thought he'd seen you.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:38.570
Don't scare me like that.

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:44.640
I wonder where he's headed...

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:46.860
Open it.

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:47.510
Yes, Sir!

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.650
Where is this?

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:03.430
Why you! What was that, payback?!

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:07.440
No-nya! Those guys can see us-nya.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:10.050
Well, well, if it isn't the Director.

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:14.070
If we had known you'd be paying us a visit, 
we would've prepared tea for you.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:15.250
How is it?

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:18.250
It's just great!

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:23.780
That's...

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:25.590
That strange tuning fork-nya!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.380
It's that thing's fault that he...

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.110
Ikuto!

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:43.520
Once Ikuto has regained his strength, I'll put him to work again.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:46.110
Make sure it's ready to go at any time.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.580
Yessir!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:53.840
That was unexpected!

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:56.040
I wish he wouldn't show up like that!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.030
I can't relax for a second...

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:01.400
Hm? It seems the cord's connection isn't right.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.970
Can you take a look?

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:03.920
Right-o.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:13.770
Maybe I should grab some grub.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:18.520
So you've managed to get all the way in here.

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:23.940
If they don't have that tuning fork, 
they can't control Ikuto-nya!

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.610
Hey, go keep a lookout for those guys-nya!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.220
Hey! Don't order me around!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:32.700
Besides, how are we supposed 
to get out of here?

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:35.810
There's no way out except through the door!

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.910
All right, now's my chance-nya!

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:41.460
It won't come out-nya.

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:47.770
Oh?

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.400
That's strange...

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:50.950
A Guardian Character!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:51.720
What?!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:53.950
Shoot-nya!

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:55.980
That's what I was trying to tell you!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.060
Yoru!

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.370
This way! Hurry!

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:09.180
The tuning fork was stolen!

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:09.970
What did you say?

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:12.520
The thief escaped through the air vents!

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:14.070
We've got to find him!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:16.370
Understood. I'll contact Director Hoshino.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.050
We've gotta get it back 
before the Director finds out!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.790
U-Understood.

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:24.530
This way?

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:30.870
You should be grateful. If not for my quick thinking, 
you would've been caught.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:44.740
Inform me the second you 
find the tuning fork!

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:46.520
Check all of the air vents!

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:58.280
They're staked out everywhere. 
We can't get out-nya.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.660
If you're gonna complain, 
just throw that tuning fork out!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:04.500
If it's just the two of us, we won't be seen.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.940
At least until we escape...

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:07.080
No way-nya!

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.350
But...

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:09.740
I said no-nya!

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:12.420
No, no, no-nya!

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:14.510
Yoru...

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:22.770
Tuning fork! Tuning fork! Tuning fork!

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:21.830
We're not letting you out of here!

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.140
Good day!

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:33.530
Clear...

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:48.190
All right! They're not posted here-nya!

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.210
We finally got out...

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.230
Did they get away?

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:56.550
Why you...

00:17:58.040 --> 00:17:59.010
Darn it!

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.380
We've been ambushed...

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:02.740
Gotcha.

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:06.230
We knew you'd try to escape 
this way, you see.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:10.930
That's why we had the men in black 
stake out every spot but this one.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.600
You won't get away!

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.240
Give us back the tuning fork!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.890
In the end, we didn't find anything, did we?

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:27.320
I guess we should just call it a day.

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.130
Yes, I suppose so.

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.890
Let's play!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.100
Found you!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.980
Go!

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.070
Wait!

00:18:57.390 --> 00:18:59.350
We won!

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:01.040
Got you!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:01.850
Good going!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:03.220
Congrats!

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.200
Kiseki!

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:11.770
If you don't want me to squash him, 
return that tuning fork!

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:15.560
You think you can oppose me?

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:17.590
I'm not bluffing, you know.

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:20.390
Okay! It's squashing time!

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.230
Um... I don't know if we should...

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:24.200
H-Here, you do it!

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.390
N-No! You do it!

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.030
But I said I don't want to!

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:30.080
Well, someone has to do it!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.520
But I don't want to!

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:32.970
I said no!

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:33.400
Stop complaining!

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:35.230
Kiseki...

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:38.900
I'm fine! Get it out of here, quickly!

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:39.900
But!

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:43.550
Damn you! Why do you think I'm 
putting up with this?!

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.270
Go!

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:49.280
Didn't I tell you to go? Hurry!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:55.750
Dammit!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:56.380
What the...

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:58.050
Yoru?

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:03.610
If you want it back so bad... Take this-nya!

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:06.430
Chichimaru!

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:07.560
I feel...

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.480
You...

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.250
That was pretty horrible-nya...

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:30.650
The next time we come here, 
we'll get that tuning fork for sure!

00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:34.820
But I'm sure they'll hide 
it somewhere else now-nya.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:36.790
Good point...

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:40.250
Man, I hate you-nya!

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:41.960
Why you...

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:44.350
Then why did you throw the fork to them?!

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:46.240
Because you got caught!

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:47.470
I was fine!

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.380
You big liar!

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:49.310
I'm serious!

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:51.800
If I hadn't saved you, 
you'd have been squashed-nya!

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:52.350
What?!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.560
Did you find them?

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.110
They're nowhere to be found.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:59.070
Man, I wonder where those guys went.

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:03.480
The Guardian Characters wouldn't 
go to Easter on their own, would they?

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:07.260
Yoru's not here either... Could it be...

00:21:07.260 --> 00:21:09.450
Ah, that was fun!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.060
So satisfying!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:14.430
I wish Kiseki and Yoru had come with us.

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:16.960
You guys!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.020
Where were you?

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:22.790
We went to the amusement park 
to find clues about Ikuto.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:26.940
The amusement park? 
No fair, I wanna go!

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:30.760
Huh? Where are Kiseki and Yoru?

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:41.580
There they are.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.450
They're sleeping together like the best of friends.

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:44.540
They sure are!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:47.830
Well, all things aside, at least 
everyone's accounted for.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:49.020
That's true.

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:51.430
They sure look worn out, though.

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:54.000
Do you think they had a fight?

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:55.630
Hey...

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:01.170
They look tired. Just leave them be.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:13.040
I'm not letting you order me around...

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:16.080
Be quiet-nya...

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:36.260
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:41.070
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.450
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:45.690
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.000
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.480
Ride On!

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.680
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.600
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:04.350
I get it.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.010
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.040
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.670
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:18.300
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:23.230
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:27.600
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:32.470
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:37.290
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:41.890
How about that?

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:45.040
My boy!

00:23:50.230 --> 00:23:51.770
Amu-chan, Amu-chan!

00:23:51.770 --> 00:23:54.410
Next time's the long-awaited 
Special Training Series!

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:55.180
Desu!

00:23:55.180 --> 00:23:56.430
Special Training Series?

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:57.580
Something like that exists?

00:23:57.580 --> 00:23:59.910
Don't sweat the details!

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:01.570
No, seriously, what is it?

00:24:01.570 --> 00:24:03.830
That's a secret until next time.

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:04.650
Desu!

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:07.050
You could at least give me a tiny clue!

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:08.940
Fu-fu-fu-fu-fu.

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:10.080
Desu.

00:24:10.080 --> 00:24:12.090
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:14.220
Fierce Battle! I'll become the Ace Player!

00:24:14.220 --> 00:24:16.990
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:24:16.990 --> 00:24:19.400
Ace? Wait, like in baseball?!
